\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 On October\~6, 2025, Videotron announced that it had been ranked Quebecers\u8217  preferred telecommunications provider in a L\'e9ger survey conducted between July\~17 and August\~2, 2025. Respondents rated Videotron as the most reliable and most trustworthy telecom in Qu\'e9bec. The excellent results confirmed Videotron\u8217 s status as the industry leader in customer service.  }
